[gd_scene load_steps=8 format=3]

; A PanoramaSkyMaterial background, drawn by the PS1 renderer as a textured
; dome. The panorama is a GradientTexture2D (no image file): hues across,
; running diagonally so the horizon and the seam (straight ahead of a
; camera facing -Z without sky rotation) both show. The environment turns
; the sky 40 degrees about Y (sky_rotation), which the dome must follow.

